sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as data-science-gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant KRP as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Registry as {registry-name}<br/>rest-container<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant Postgres as {registry-name}-postgres<br/>5432/TCP PostgreSQL

    Note over Client,Postgres: Flow 1: Model Registration via Gateway API Ingress

    Client->>Gateway: POST /v2/models<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    Gateway->>KRP: Forward request<br/>HTTPS/8443, TLS
    KRP->>K8sAPI: TokenReview<br/>HTTPS/6443
    K8sAPI-->>KRP: Token Valid
    KRP->>K8sAPI: SubjectAccessReview<br/>HTTPS/6443
    K8sAPI-->>KRP: Access Granted
    KRP->>Registry: Proxied request<br/>HTTP/8080 (localhost)
    Registry->>Postgres: SQL INSERT<br/>PostgreSQL/5432, Password auth
    Postgres-->>Registry: Row inserted
    Registry-->>KRP: 200 OK (JSON)
    KRP-->>Gateway: HTTPS Response
    Gateway-->>Client: 200 OK

    Note over Client,Postgres: Flow 2: Direct Service Access (Internal)

    participant InternalClient as Internal Client<br/>(in-cluster)

    InternalClient->>KRP: GET /v2/models<br/>HTTPS/8443, Bearer Token
    KRP->>K8sAPI: TokenReview + SAR<br/>HTTPS/6443
    K8sAPI-->>KRP: Authorized
    KRP->>Registry: Proxied request<br/>HTTP/8080 (localhost)
    Registry->>Postgres: SQL SELECT<br/>PostgreSQL/5432
    Postgres-->>Registry: Result set
    Registry-->>KRP: 200 OK (JSON)
    KRP-->>InternalClient: HTTPS Response

    Note over Client,Postgres: Flow 3: Operator Reconciliation

    participant Controller as Operator Controller

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Watch ModelRegistry CRs<br/>HTTPS/6443, SA token
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: CR Event (Added/Modified)
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Deployment<br/>HTTPS/6443
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Service<br/>HTTPS/6443
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update HTTPRoute<br/>HTTPS/6443
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update NetworkPolicy<br/>HTTPS/6443
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update RBAC resources<br/>HTTPS/6443
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Reconciliation complete
